«
  @ ------------------------------------------------------------
  @  ParetoAll
  @  Everything about one point, tagged: CDF, PDF, CDFc, mean, deviation.
  @  Author & design          : Jean Wilson
  @  Co-authors & programming  : Claude & Claude Code (Anthropic)
  @  Arguments may be given loose or bundled in a list of 3; that list is
  @  what LastArguments reports, and its length is checked before use.
  @ ------------------------------------------------------------
  IF DUP TypeName "list" == THEN IF DUP Size 3 ≠ THEN "ParetoAll: needs 3 arguments" DoError END Explode Drop END
  → xmv apv Xv « xmv 0 + apv 0 + Xv 0 + → xm ap X « 'IFTE(X<xm;0;1-(xm/X)^ap)' →Num 'Kc' STO Kc "CDF" →Tag 'IFTE(X<xm;0;ap*(xm^ap)/(X^(ap+1)))' →Num "PDF" →Tag 'IFTE(X<xm;1;(xm/X)^ap)' →Num "CDFc" →Tag 'IFTE(ap>1;ap*xm/(ap-1);Ⓒ∞)' →Num "μ" →Tag 'IFTE(ap>2;(xm/(ap-1))*√(ap/(ap-2));IFTE(ap>1;Ⓒ∞;Ⓒ?))' →Num "sx" →Tag { Kc } PURGE xmv apv Xv 3 →List Drop » »
»
